Subject: [PATCH 1/5] refactor(utils): delete dead helpers -- both duplicate
 sq_diff/square_mean pairs (utils.py:20-24 and :281-287, zero callers
 anywhere); GP (zero callers AND broken: references numpyro/dist which utils
 never imports -> NameError if called); rej_sampling_new, find_nearest,
 find_nearest_2D, find_index, find_index_b, randdist (zero callers); dense
 difference_matrix / difference_matrix_partial / difference_pairs /
 difference_pairs_2d, superseded by aligned_difference_pairs (efc8680); drop
 the dead difference_matrix name from inference_functions.py:14 import. Kept:
 dist_euclid (VAE_Train.py:89), exp_sq_kernel (main.py:284 args['gp_kernel']),
 aligned_difference_pairs. utils.py 288 -> 115 lines. Behavior-preserving by
 construction (only uncalled code removed); verified 26/26 tests pass.

